@host = http://localhost:5003
@proposalId = cole-o-id-retornado-no-create

### Criar rascunho
POST {{host}}/api/v1/proposals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ana Souza",
  "taxId": "52998224725",
  "email": "ana@email.com"
}

### Completar os dados
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/proposals/{{proposalId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "11999998888",
  "birthDate": "1990-05-15",
  "street": "Rua A, 100",
  "city": "Sao Paulo",
  "state": "SP",
  "postalCode": "01310100",
  "motherName": "Maria Souza"
}

### Consultar
GET {{host}}/api/v1/proposals/{{proposalId}}

### Finalizar (publica proposta-conta-finalizada)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/proposals/{{proposalId}}/finalize
